      "seed": 1745643312,
      "version": 1353,
      "versionNonce": 620369276,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786677643990,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Neetcode\n1. Sorting\n- .sort vs sorted(), .sort() preferred since in-line and more memory optimized\n- awareness of keywords and params to leverage default native language \n\n2. pythonic programming \n- unpacking\n- enumerate1 \n- zip\n- inequiality\n- min(), max()\n\n3. lists\n4. Stacks & Queues\n5. 2D lists\n6. Hashmap and Hashsets\n7. Heaps/Priority Queues\n8. Sorted Dicts and Sorted Sets\n\n--\n\nNeetcode cont.\n\nTree traversal vs. Linked-list traversal\nclass TreeNode:\n    def __init__(self, val=0, left=None, right=None):\n        self.val = val\n        self.left = left\n        self.right = right\n\n--\nStandard Libraries to know\n1. collections\n2. heapq\n3. bisect\n4. defaultdict\n    - convienent way to initiate values of dicts",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Neetcode\n1. Sorting\n- .sort vs sorted(), .sort() preferred since in-line and more memory optimized\n- awareness of keywords and params to leverage default native language \n\n2. pythonic programming \n- unpacking\n- enumerate1 \n- zip\n- inequiality\n- min(), max()\n\n3. lists\n4. Stacks & Queues\n5. 2D lists\n6. Hashmap and Hashsets\n7. Heaps/Priority Queues\n8. Sorted Dicts and Sorted Sets\n\n--\n\nNeetcode cont.\n\nTree traversal vs. Linked-list traversal\nclass TreeNode:\n    def __init__(self, val=0, left=None, right=None):\n        self.val = val\n        self.left = left\n        self.right = right\n\n--\nStandard Libraries to know\n1. collections\n2. heapq\n3. bisect\n4. defaultdict\n    - convienent way to initiate values of dicts",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2s"
    },
    {
      "id": "rW93iFSDYkqgwgt0Ju_-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3044.4608272425567,
      "y": -1070.9261124435343,
      "width": 716.4993896484375,
      "height": 750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
