      "seed": 1045942224,
      "version": 1349,
      "versionNonce": 1568519036,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786677643667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Learning Python (book)\n1. FUNDAMENTALS\n- numbers & expressions\n- dynamic typing\n- strings\n    - print f\"string{var}\"\n- lists and dictionary\n    - list.append vs. list.extend\n- tuples1\n\n2. LOGICAL FLOW\n- if/else\n- for, while loops\n- comprehensions\n- pass, continue, break\n\n3. FUNCTIONS\n- functions (def my_func(args: args_type = default_value) -> return.typ :\n- lambda single_arg:\n\n4. MODULES\n- import ...1\n- from ... import ...\n- Could be our own scripts \n6. EXCEPTIONS & TESTING\n    try:\n    except: \n    else:\n    finally:\n        ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Learning Python (book)\n1. FUNDAMENTALS\n- numbers & expressions\n- dynamic typing\n- strings\n    - print f\"string{var}\"\n- lists and dictionary\n    - list.append vs. list.extend\n- tuples1\n\n2. LOGICAL FLOW\n- if/else\n- for, while loops\n- comprehensions\n- pass, continue, break\n\n3. FUNCTIONS\n- functions (def my_func(args: args_type = default_value) -> return.typ :\n- lambda single_arg:\n\n4. MODULES\n- import ...1\n- from ... import ...\n- Could be our own scripts \n6. EXCEPTIONS & TESTING\n    try:\n    except: \n    else:\n    finally:\n        ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2t"
    },
    {
      "id": "yr4Hyvv2qKiW2dkxLm99V",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": -368.43125050873095,
      "y": 851.7652623229576,
